      "message": "How will clients of libion get this exactly? If a client of libion does\n\n#include \u003clinux/ion.h\u003e\n\nAs per the bp file in libion, do they not get the kernel headers that libion exposes: https://android.googlesource.com/platform/system/core/+/master/libion/kernel-headers/linux instead of the kernel exported headers? Won\u0027t that header not have the IDs?",
